        "TileImage": "$($repository cb1cd30b-cdad-4b41-8036-568dad9ce1ba).Image",
        "Description": "Good work 47.\r\rUnfortunately, we were unable to find much about William Candler and his employers. However, we have found something from Powell. \r\rTurns out he&apos;s been payed by Dexy Barat, a talent manager for The Class and Wes Liston.\r\rWe also found out she&apos;s been involved with Mrs Mookjai, who has been involved with Dexy in significant capacity. We believed it may be a blackmail.\r\rGood hunting 47.",
